:''Not to be confused with [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)]] or [[Kuwagata Cat (Switch Special Cat)]].''
'''Kabuto Cat''' is a Special Cat that was implemented in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.0 Update|Patch 1.0.0]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] Its goal was to be used as promotional material and was advertised as a playable unit in several CoroCoro Comic issues. When the [https://corocoro.jp/news/22972/ January 2019 CoroCoro Comic Issue] came out, it was officially distributed starting December 15, 2018. As of [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], Kabuto Cat was given another chance to be obtained in the [[Catnip Challenges|Missions]] tab once clearing [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] in the [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter. Kabuto Cat is exclusive to the Japanese (JP) version <u>only</u>.

